# Agreement Entry into Force

This scope computes the date the agreement becomes legally binding based on the latest notification date.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementEntry:
  input latest_notification_date content date
  output effective_date content date
```

## Entry into Force

The agreement enters into force 14 days after the date of receipt of the latest notification.

```catala
scope AgreementEntry:
  date round down
  definition effective_date equals latest_notification_date + 14 day
```